# 🚀 AI-Powered Dynamic Pricing Engine for Small E-Commerce

An intelligent, full-stack dynamic pricing and inventory markdown engine built for small e-commerce businesses. The system automates competitor price scraping simulations, calculates AI-driven price adjustments based on inventory age and market trends, and features a modern real-time analytics dashboard.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

* **Backend:** Python, FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, SQLite, Pydantic
* **Frontend:** React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Lucide Icons, Recharts (for dynamic analytics charts)
* **Architecture:** RESTful API with CORS enabled for seamless client-server communication

---

## ✨ Key Features

1. **Automated Competitor Benchmarking:** Simulates real-time market competitor scraping to track pricing gaps.
2. **AI Markdown & Dynamic Pricing Logic:** Automatically adjusts product pricing using rules based on inventory aging (e.g., items older than 30 days trigger tactical markdowns).
3. **Strategic AI Insights:** Generates tailored market trends, recommended actions, confidence scores, and projected revenue boosts for individual SKUs.
4. **Live Interactive Dashboard:** Real-time metrics tracking total SKUs, aging stock alerts, and multi-variable price adaptation curves.
5. **Bulk Repricing & Data Export:** Execute mass repricing rules with a single click and export complete inventory analytics reports in JSON format.

---

## ⚙️ Project Setup & Installation

### 1. Clone the Repository & Setup Backend
```bash
# Navigate to project directory
cd dynamic-pricing-engine

# Activate virtual environment (if using venv)
source venv/bin/activate  # On Windows use: venv\Scripts\activate

# Install backend dependencies
pip install fastapi uvicorn sqlalchemy pydantic requests

venv\Scripts\activate
# Run FastAPI Server
uvicorn main:app --reload

Backend will run on http://127.0.0.1:8000

2. Run the Frontend Dashboard
Bash
# Navigate to frontend directory
cd frontend

# Install dependencies
npm install

# Run Vite development server
npm run dev
Frontend dashboard will be accessible at http://localhost:5173

📊 API Endpoints Overview
GET / - Engine health check and welcome message.

GET /products/ - Retrieve all active product SKUs from the database.

POST /products/ - Register a new product into the inventory catalog.

POST /calculate-price/{product_id} - Trigger AI & competitor-based dynamic price calculation for a specific SKU.

POST /ai-insights/{product_id} - Fetch strategic AI advice and market trends.

POST /bulk-reprice/ - Perform bulk automated markdowns on aging inventory.

GET /analytics/trends/ - Stream live database metrics for UI visualizer charts.  